I'm a cow. Okay. So the cow took them around. And when we got to the dairy section, it was really hot. And it said, I'm a cow. do milk. What else has milk? Now, when the signs were down, parents and kids just went to the dairy section. But when the signs were up, we got 33% more conversations than when the signs were down. So we published that work and we were astounded. But one of my friends from the University of

